WEBVTT

1
00:00:45.416 --> 00:00:49.250
In the previous verse, Lord Krishna made clear

2
00:00:49.250 --> 00:00:53.083
that He is the supreme master of all worlds.

3
00:00:53.083 --> 00:00:55.875
Now in the tenth chapter's fourth

4
00:00:55.875 --> 00:00:59.250
and fifth verses, Lord Krishna explains

5
00:00:59.250 --> 00:01:03.250
how He is of all the qualities and characteristics

6
00:01:03.250 --> 00:01:06.750
seen in every living being

7
00:01:06.750 --> 00:01:08.541
the master and source.

8
00:01:13.541 --> 00:01:16.500
Lord Krishna, as the supreme Lord,

9
00:01:16.500 --> 00:01:21.375
is not only the creator of the
living and non-living world,

10
00:01:21.375 --> 00:01:24.500
but the original source of all qualities

11
00:01:24.500 --> 00:01:28.791
present in every living being.

12
00:01:28.791 --> 00:01:30.791
Lord Krishna first

13
00:01:30.791 --> 00:01:33.916
mentions buddhi – intellect – which of objects

14
00:01:33.916 --> 00:01:37.291
and situations, of things, the right perspective

15
00:01:37.291 --> 00:01:38.833
to analyse and

16
00:01:38.833 --> 00:01:42.250
to make the right decisions – the ability.

17
00:01:42.250 --> 00:01:45.083
Intellect helps us in life

18
00:01:45.083 --> 00:01:46.583
to prioritise tasks

19
00:01:46.583 --> 00:01:49.750
and create balance.

20
00:01:49.750 --> 00:01:53.000
Its companion is jnana – knowledge –

21
00:01:53.000 --> 00:01:56.250
which clarifies the difference
between soul and matter.

22
00:01:56.250 --> 00:02:01.166
Knowledge is essential for spiritual awakening.

23
00:02:01.166 --> 00:02:03.958
Asammohah – meaning freedom

24
00:02:03.958 --> 00:02:06.083
from doubt and illusion –

25
00:02:06.083 --> 00:02:09.291
the clarity that arises

26
00:02:09.291 --> 00:02:10.916
when one through right

27
00:02:10.916 --> 00:02:15.041
spiritual knowledge understands life.

28
00:02:15.041 --> 00:02:17.000
It removes illusion,

29
00:02:17.000 --> 00:02:18.083
just as through transparent

30
00:02:18.083 --> 00:02:22.125
glass the view is perfectly clear.

31
00:02:22.125 --> 00:02:24.666
Kshama – forgiveness –

32
00:02:24.666 --> 00:02:27.750
teaches us tolerance and the ability

33
00:02:27.750 --> 00:02:30.958
to overlook the mistakes of others,

34
00:02:30.958 --> 00:02:34.250
which promotes harmony and peace.

35
00:02:34.250 --> 00:02:37.166
Satyam – meaning truthfulness –

36
00:02:37.166 --> 00:02:40.250
is related to speaking such facts

37
00:02:40.250 --> 00:02:43.000
that benefit others

38
00:02:43.000 --> 00:02:47.333
and them toward spiritual growth lead.

39
00:02:47.333 --> 00:02:48.708
Truth's meaning

40
00:02:48.708 --> 00:02:51.458
is not just to please others.

41
00:02:51.458 --> 00:02:54.291
For it, courage is needed,

42
00:02:54.291 --> 00:02:57.166
which is essential for progress.

43
00:02:57.166 --> 00:02:58.458
Lord Krishna also emphasises damah –

44
00:02:58.458 --> 00:03:00.625
meaning control of the senses –

45
00:03:00.625 --> 00:03:04.291
and shamah – meaning control of the mind –

46
00:03:04.291 --> 00:03:05.875
on these.

47
00:03:05.875 --> 00:03:08.416
While damah controls the senses

48
00:03:08.416 --> 00:03:10.833
and stops sinful actions,

49
00:03:10.833 --> 00:03:14.833
shamah ensures that the mind itself

50
00:03:14.833 --> 00:03:20.958
remains calm by unnecessary
desires or distractions undisturbed.

51
00:03:20.958 --> 00:03:22.583
Lord Krishna explains

52
00:03:22.583 --> 00:03:26.291
that sukham – meaning joy – and duhkham –

53
00:03:26.291 --> 00:03:30.000
meaning suffering – are life's dual experiences,

54
00:03:30.000 --> 00:03:31.291
which from our karma

55
00:03:31.291 --> 00:03:34.041
and material existence arise.

56
00:03:34.041 --> 00:03:36.458
In the same way bhava – meaning

57
00:03:36.458 --> 00:03:39.791
birth – and abhava – meaning death –

58
00:03:39.791 --> 00:03:42.750
in this material world life's physical

59
00:03:42.750 --> 00:03:46.250
beginning and end represent.

60
00:03:46.250 --> 00:03:48.208
Bhayam – or fear –

61
00:03:48.208 --> 00:03:49.458
from attachment to

62
00:03:49.458 --> 00:03:51.625
material outcomes arises,

63
00:03:51.625 --> 00:03:54.500
while abhayam – meaning fearlessness –

64
00:03:54.500 --> 00:03:57.166
from trust in Me, Lord Krishna,

65
00:03:57.166 --> 00:03:59.541
and from understanding

66
00:03:59.541 --> 00:04:01.583
one's spiritual nature is born.

67
00:04:01.583 --> 00:04:04.125
Ahimsa is about not causing

68
00:04:04.125 --> 00:04:08.000
physical or mental harm to others,

69
00:04:08.000 --> 00:04:11.208
and in it, guiding others toward their

70
00:04:11.208 --> 00:04:15.000
spiritual wellbeing is also included.

71
00:04:15.000 --> 00:04:17.875
Samata – meaning equanimity –

72
00:04:17.875 --> 00:04:19.541
amid life's ups and downs

73
00:04:19.541 --> 00:04:22.166
is the art of remaining balanced,

74
00:04:22.166 --> 00:04:25.916
free from excessive attachment or aversion.

75
00:04:25.916 --> 00:04:30.000
Tushthi – meaning contentment – is that joy

76
00:04:30.000 --> 00:04:31.500
which by Lord Krishna's grace

77
00:04:31.500 --> 00:04:32.583
of the things that come,

78
00:04:32.583 --> 00:04:35.500
by accepting them arises,

79
00:04:35.500 --> 00:04:36.541
for which

80
00:04:36.541 --> 00:04:40.250
no material effort has been made.

81
00:04:40.250 --> 00:04:42.125
Tushthi – contentment –

82
00:04:42.125 --> 00:04:44.000
is joy which by Lord

83
00:04:44.000 --> 00:04:46.833
Krishna's grace, of all the situations

84
00:04:46.833 --> 00:04:51.708
and objects that come, by
accepting them naturally arises.

85
00:04:51.708 --> 00:04:54.416
This joy is by mere material

86
00:04:54.416 --> 00:04:56.333
gain through excessive

87
00:04:56.333 --> 00:04:58.166
effort, by acquiring something –

88
00:04:58.166 --> 00:05:00.083
never received this way.

89
00:05:00.083 --> 00:05:02.750
Lord Krishna tapah – meaning tapasya –

90
00:05:02.750 --> 00:05:05.583
and danam – charity – also mentions.

91
00:05:05.583 --> 00:05:08.333
Tapah refers to voluntary

92
00:05:08.333 --> 00:05:11.125
discipline for spiritual progress,

93
00:05:11.125 --> 00:05:13.666
such as fasting or for spiritual

94
00:05:13.666 --> 00:05:17.458
practice waking early in the morning.

95
00:05:17.458 --> 00:05:20.250
Danam is for a higher purpose,

96
00:05:20.250 --> 00:05:24.500
sharing one's resources selflessly,

97
00:05:24.500 --> 00:05:27.958
especially for spiritual causes.

98
00:05:27.958 --> 00:05:31.750
Finally, Lord Krishna sheds
light on yasha – meaning fame –

99
00:05:31.750 --> 00:05:33.000
and ayasha –

100
00:05:33.000 --> 00:05:36.500
meaning ill-repute.

101
00:05:36.500 --> 00:05:37.916
Yasha, devotion,

102
00:05:37.916 --> 00:05:39.833
and service – such virtues –

103
00:05:39.833 --> 00:05:42.208
being recognised for them is what it is about,

104
00:05:42.208 --> 00:05:43.500
while ayasha

105
00:05:43.500 --> 00:05:44.291
is from wrong or

106
00:05:44.291 --> 00:05:46.708
harmful actions

107
00:05:46.708 --> 00:05:49.708
the resulting ill-repute.

108
00:05:49.708 --> 00:05:53.625
Lord Krishna sheds light on this
– that all these qualities,

109
00:05:53.625 --> 00:05:56.708
diverse as they are in their expressions,

110
00:05:56.708 --> 00:06:00.000
all from Him alone arise.

111
00:06:00.000 --> 00:06:02.000
By accepting this truth,

112
00:06:02.000 --> 00:06:03.208
with Lord Krishna

113
00:06:03.208 --> 00:06:05.958
we deepen our relationship,

114
00:06:05.958 --> 00:06:08.541
understanding that of our existence

115
00:06:08.541 --> 00:06:12.958
every aspect, whether it seems good or bad,

116
00:06:12.958 --> 00:06:16.791
is a part of His divine arrangement.

117
00:06:21.333 --> 00:06:23.875
Sometimes you ask yourself –

118
00:06:23.875 --> 00:06:28.708
why do I live in so much fear?

119
00:06:28.708 --> 00:06:29.458
In life,

120
00:06:29.458 --> 00:06:35.375
how does the shadow of fear become so long?

121
00:06:35.375 --> 00:06:39.833
I always remind you –

122
00:06:39.833 --> 00:06:43.750
when you place your trust in Me

123
00:06:43.750 --> 00:06:49.291
and recognise your spiritual nature,

124
00:06:49.291 --> 00:06:53.750
then the protective armour of fearlessness

125
00:06:53.750 --> 00:06:58.375
always keeps you safe.

126
00:06:58.375 --> 00:07:00.375
Every life surrendered

127
00:07:00.375 --> 00:07:06.291
into My hands always finds My companionship.

128
00:07:06.333 --> 00:07:09.833
At every step taken, at every turn,

129
00:07:09.833 --> 00:07:12.166
through every challenge –

130
00:07:12.166 --> 00:07:16.041
equanimity is the key, the chabi, of life.

131
00:07:16.041 --> 00:07:20.333
In life ups and downs will always come, but

132
00:07:20.333 --> 00:07:24.083
if you remain steady within,

133
00:07:24.083 --> 00:07:27.458
knowing that everything

134
00:07:27.458 --> 00:07:30.750
is part of My plan,

135
00:07:30.750 --> 00:07:34.541
then you will stay at peace.

136
00:07:34.541 --> 00:07:36.916
No pride in success,

137
00:07:36.916 --> 00:07:40.375
no despair in failure.

138
00:07:40.375 --> 00:07:43.791
See both in the light of knowledge.

139
00:07:43.791 --> 00:07:47.750
Both will become the steps of your growth,

140
00:07:47.750 --> 00:07:50.291
the rungs on the ladder of progress.

141
00:07:50.291 --> 00:07:54.750
To experience the natural joy of contentment,

142
00:07:54.750 --> 00:07:59.458
the endless race of materialism must be paused,

143
00:07:59.458 --> 00:08:01.791
and what you receive

144
00:08:01.791 --> 00:08:05.333
with gratitude must be accepted.

145
00:08:05.333 --> 00:08:08.416
Trust in My words –

146
00:08:08.416 --> 00:08:14.625
the more you align your own
mind with these divine qualities,

147
00:08:14.625 --> 00:08:19.708
the richer and more meaningful
your life will become.

148
00:08:24.083 --> 00:08:27.375
Can a family be held together only

149
00:08:27.375 --> 00:08:32.666
through the policy of harshness
and punishment?

150
00:08:32.666 --> 00:08:34.833
No.

151
00:08:34.833 --> 00:08:38.041
In family life, the divine qualities

152
00:08:38.041 --> 00:08:40.458
of forgiveness and non-violence

153
00:08:40.458 --> 00:08:44.750
sow the seeds of harmony and love.

154
00:08:44.750 --> 00:08:48.083
When someone in your family makes a mistake,

155
00:08:48.083 --> 00:08:50.541
the darkness of anger and resentment

156
00:08:50.541 --> 00:08:55.875
can cloud the mind.

157
00:08:55.875 --> 00:08:58.875
But I teach you

158
00:08:58.875 --> 00:09:01.625
that forgiveness is not of weakness,

159
00:09:01.625 --> 00:09:04.583
but a sign of supreme strength,

160
00:09:04.583 --> 00:09:08.208
which gives new life to broken relationships.

161
00:09:08.208 --> 00:09:11.416
Have you ever experienced this?

162
00:09:11.416 --> 00:09:13.541
Forgiveness shows

163
00:09:13.541 --> 00:09:17.500
that greater than being right

164
00:09:17.500 --> 00:09:20.666
is being loving.

165
00:09:20.666 --> 00:09:22.916
Ahimsa is not

166
00:09:22.916 --> 00:09:27.750
limited only to physical non-violence.

167
00:09:27.750 --> 00:09:30.708
To be truly non-violent,

168
00:09:30.708 --> 00:09:31.916
on your words

169
00:09:31.916 --> 00:09:36.416
and on the meaning hidden
within them too you must pay attention.

170
00:09:36.416 --> 00:09:39.291
A harsh word

171
00:09:39.291 --> 00:09:42.250
or sharp criticism

172
00:09:42.250 --> 00:09:43.500
on the body

173
00:09:43.500 --> 00:09:47.000
can cause pain deeper than a physical wound.

174
00:09:47.000 --> 00:09:52.916
In your speech and actions
always keep compassion.

175
00:09:52.916 --> 00:09:56.750
Not just to avoid causing harm,

176
00:09:56.750 --> 00:10:01.041
but for the upliftment of your loved ones,

177
00:10:01.041 --> 00:10:04.166
to give them strength.

178
00:10:04.166 --> 00:10:06.000
When your family

179
00:10:06.000 --> 00:10:09.250
absorbs these divine qualities,

180
00:10:09.250 --> 00:10:12.875
then differences and misunderstandings

181
00:10:12.875 --> 00:10:16.291
transform into opportunities for growth,

182
00:10:16.291 --> 00:10:21.708
And disagreements become moments
that bring stability

183
00:10:21.708 --> 00:10:25.583
and strength to your relationships.

184
00:10:25.583 --> 00:10:29.833
By bringing these eternal truths into practice,

185
00:10:29.833 --> 00:10:32.458
your home into a temple of peace

186
00:10:32.458 --> 00:10:36.416
and love is transformed.

187
00:10:41.000 --> 00:10:44.875
In today's competitive world of work,

188
00:10:44.875 --> 00:10:47.375
do you ever wonder

189
00:10:47.375 --> 00:10:50.208
how between success and defeat

190
00:10:50.208 --> 00:10:54.666
your mind can remain undisturbed?

191
00:10:54.666 --> 00:10:56.333
In professional life,

192
00:10:56.333 --> 00:10:59.291
between equanimity and the
balance of fame and ill-repute

193
00:10:59.291 --> 00:11:03.083
is the foundation of stability,

194
00:11:03.083 --> 00:11:06.458
like the spine that supports the body.

195
00:11:06.458 --> 00:11:11.041
At the workplace, success and recognition

196
00:11:11.041 --> 00:11:14.458
scatter the golden rays of fame,

197
00:11:14.458 --> 00:11:16.166
while failures

198
00:11:16.166 --> 00:11:20.375
and challenges bring clouds of criticism.

199
00:11:20.375 --> 00:11:24.416
Both are inseparable parts of the cycle of life.

200
00:11:24.416 --> 00:11:27.375
I in both situations

201
00:11:27.375 --> 00:11:30.708
inspire you to remain balanced.

202
00:11:30.708 --> 00:11:35.083
When people praise or honour you,

203
00:11:35.083 --> 00:11:37.208
receive it not with ego,

204
00:11:37.208 --> 00:11:40.458
but with humility and gratitude.

205
00:11:40.458 --> 00:11:42.333
Receive it that way.

206
00:11:42.333 --> 00:11:45.291
In the same way, when you face criticism

207
00:11:45.291 --> 00:11:49.208
or obstacles, do not be disheartened.

208
00:11:49.208 --> 00:11:52.041
By embracing equanimity, you rise above

209
00:11:52.041 --> 00:11:55.208
momentary joy and sorrow,

210
00:11:55.208 --> 00:11:59.333
remaining calm, focused,
and consistently motivated.

211
00:11:59.333 --> 00:12:01.750
In your professional journey,

212
00:12:01.750 --> 00:12:04.083
by walking this path

213
00:12:04.083 --> 00:12:06.958
you will not only achieve success,

214
00:12:06.958 --> 00:12:11.375
but also find that inner peace

215
00:12:11.375 --> 00:12:14.958
which is the mark of true prosperity.
